# Testimony of Trust (Q217), a second class-change testimony for humans, played by a level 38
# Knight, every script roll pinned to 0: Hollint starts it and pays the level 37 set's
# Dimensional Diamonds (96 for a human, once per character) with his letters to the elves
# and the dark elves; Hierarch Asterios wants the Seed of Verdure and the Breath of Winds of
# Actea and Luell, the guardians a dryad or a lirein calls; Thifiell sends the traveller to
# Clayton, who wants the basilisk plasma, honey dew and stakato ichor of ten kills each;
# Hollint sends a letter to Seresin, who sends it on to Kakai and Lockirin; Manakia wants
# ten Windsus parasites, Nikola ten Porta heartstones; Hollint's recommendation earns the
# Mark of Trust from Biotin; then relog. A dryad's or a lirein's call is not played (a
# script spawn's offset is drawn outside the script draws here); the guardians stand in the
# world from the start. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q217_testimony_of_trust.golden
character Trusty 38
class 4
random always 0
script quest.Q217_TestimonyOfTrust
item 2734 2735 2736 2737 2738 2739 2740 2741 2742 2743 2744 2745 2746 2747 2748 2749 2750 2751 2752 2753 2754 2755 2756 2757 2758 2759 2760 2761 7562
page villagemaster/30191.htm
page villagemaster/30154.htm
page villagemaster/30358.htm
page trainer/30464.htm
page default/30657.htm
page villagemaster/30565.htm
page trainer/30515.htm
page default/30531.htm
page default/30621.htm
page villagemaster/30031.htm
page script/quest/Q217_TestimonyOfTrust/
